{% extends "master.twig" %}

{% block content %}
<!-- ======= travel Section ======= -->
<section id="travel" class="section-show">
    
    <div class="resume">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>london christmas 2024</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhYjBC9uiDY" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>Visiting London during Christmas, especially the Theatre District, Covent Garden, Leicester Square, Trafalgar Square, City of Westminster, Tower Hill, Tower of London, Tower Bridge, Jubilee Park, Canary Wharf, South Dock and Millwall.
                        Had a lovely short trip. 2024 welcomed me with open arms and warm hugs. 2025 continues...
                        <br> <br> Shot on iPhone
                        <br> Kendrick Lamar audio from ‪@JazzysWorldTV‬
                        <br>Music by SFmusic</p>
                        <p><b>Role: Cinematographer|Editor</b></p>
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="resume mt5">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Langtang National Park Trailer</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vm7PSIjrDgQ?si=6-CjJ5Ou5NiYEZLs" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>
                        Last winter we explored Langtang. It was a 7 days trek. This time we experienced magical snowfall like never before. In this travel series, we share our experience with you. 
                        </p>
                        <p>Gear Used:
Camera: Fujifilm X-T3
Lens: XF 8-16mm f/2.8 R LM WR
           XF 16-55mm f/2.8 R LM WR
           XF 50-140mm f/2.8 R LM OIS WR
           XF 35mm f/2 R WR
Drone: Mavic Air 2
Stabilizer: DJI Ronin S Gimbal
                  Manfrotto 055 Carbon Fiber, Manfrotto XPRO Magnesium Ball Head
Mic: Saramonic Blink 500 Pro B2</p>
<p><b>Role: Camera Operator</b></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
    
    <div class="resume">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Tulip garden</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xRtbPPlGLDE" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p> 24.04.2025 <br>
                        Warwick Tulip Garden visit in Spring 
                         <br> Capitalism, politics, and the constant competition of the world blinded me from truly seeing and living life. There was a time during the extreme UK winter when I could barely see the sunlight, which left me feeling drained, tired all the time, and no enthusiasm. This year, the sun started showing up in the last week of April. After a few days, I felt like summer was here but it was just spring, still beautiful though. Before going out to feel the sunlight again, there was a voice inside me, screaming louder and louder, saying "Aaja sansar herna janchu, aaja ma sansar herchu."
                          <br>Audio from artlist.io Roie Shpigler - White Morning
                           <br> Shot on iPhone
                        <p><b>Role: Cinematographer|Editor</b></p>
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="resume">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>spring hike, peak district national park</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/W4WHeg1ky-k" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>Hiking through the Peak District near Ashbourne, we take time to reconnect with nature, exploring limestone landscapes shaped by centuries, wandering through historic charm villages, and admiring the timeless beauty of English architecture, all wrapped in the fresh bloom of spring.</p>
                        
                        Shot on iPhone 
                        <p><b>Role: Cinematographer|Editor</b></p>
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
    
    
    <div class="resume">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Ruby Valley Trailer</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EAbfwNr6Q_8?si=Zqz5of01_PilnubJ" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>
                            
                            Our latest attempt to showcase the beauty this little country - Nepal has to offer. This time around, we ventured to a remote but surreally beautiful place called Ruby Valley. Seated on the lap of the great Ganesh Himal ranges, Ruby Valley has been a distinctly unique experience for us.
                        
                        </p>
                        <p><b>Role: Camera Operator</b></p>
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="resume mt-4">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Ruby Valley Trek | Full Video</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/QggEzY2LY6k?si=JpnSSA3o-B_ZeV0P"
                        title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        
                        <p>Never have we been so pleasantly surprised by such an awe-inspiring piece of landscape and the local inhabitants. We expected the usual visual highlights and the same touristic experience and hospitality but Ruby Valley managed to deliver much more than mere sightseeing. Join us to see for yourself this well-kept secret of the Himalayas.
                        </p>
                        <p><b>Role: Camera Operator</b></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</section>
<!-- End travel Section -->
{% endblock %}